  <Strings>
    <Section>s1-0</Section>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>2544</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>12000029</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>ねえ、&lt;Annie&gt;。
ココに住んでた人たちは
どこに行っちゃったの？</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Ei, &lt;Annie&gt;... O que aconteceu
com o povo que morava
nesta floresta?</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>0</SpeakerId>
      <Id>3</Id>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>2584</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>1200002a</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>そこまではわたしも……</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Isso eu também não sei...</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>4</Id>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>2629</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>1200002b</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>森に棲みついたバイラスに
食べられちゃったとか？
うわぁ、コワイねぇー!!</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Será que algum Birus que vive
nesta mata comeu todo mundo?
Uuuh, que medo!</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>0</SpeakerId>
      <Id>5</Id>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>2729</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>1200002c</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>笑いながら言っても、
誰も怖がらないぞ。</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Ninguém tem medo se você
fala sorrindo.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Id>6</Id>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>2781</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>1200002d</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>どうした、&lt;Annie&gt;？</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>O que foi, &lt;Annie&gt;?</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Id>7</Id>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>2818</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>1200002e</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>な、なんでもないです。</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>N-Não é nada...</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>8</Id>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>2872</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>1200002f</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>ああっ、&lt;Annie&gt;がコワがってる!!</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Ha, a &lt;Annie&gt; tá com medo!</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>0</SpeakerId>
      <Id>9</Id>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>2894</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>12000030</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>怖がってなんていないわ！</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Claro que não estou com medo!</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>10</Id>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>2923</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>12000031</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>そんなに強がっちゃって。
&lt;Annie&gt;って意外と
コワがりさんだネ♪</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Negar só deixa mais na cara!
Quem diria que a &lt;Annie&gt; é
uma medrosinha♪</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>0</SpeakerId>
      <Id>11</Id>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>2973</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>12000032</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>もう……いいかげんにして！</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Ah, pare com isso, por favor!</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>12</Id>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>3213</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>12000033</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>うわあぁぁ……!!</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Uaaaaaah!</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>0</SpeakerId>
      <Id>13</Id>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>3307</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>12000034</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>&lt;Mao&gt;……！　どこだ？</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>&lt;Mao&gt;...! Onde ele está?</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Id>14</Id>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>3441</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>12000035</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>……落とし穴か。</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>...Neste buraco.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>3</SpeakerId>
      <Id>15</Id>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>3463</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>12000036</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>大丈夫？</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Você está bem?</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>16</Id>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>3511</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>12000037</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>ん……いてて……
たぶん、大丈夫だと思うけど……</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Nnn... ai. Acho que tô bem, mas...</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>0</SpeakerId>
      <Id>17</Id>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>3532</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>12000038</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>上がれそうか？</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Consegue subir?</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Id>18</Id>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>3553</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>12000039</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>ここじゃムリだね。</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Daqui, não.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>0</SpeakerId>
      <Id>19</Id>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>3581</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>1200003a</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>あ、あっちからなら戻れそう。
ちょっと待ってて。</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Ah, mas acho que dá pra chegar
aí por ali. Espera um
instantinho, tá?</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>0</SpeakerId>
      <Id>20</Id>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>3745</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>1200003b</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>エヘヘ……</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Hehehe...</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>0</SpeakerId>
      <Id>21</Id>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>3805</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>1200003c</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>注意して進もう。</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Tenham mais cuidado.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>3</SpeakerId>
      <Id>22</Id>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
  </Strings>
  <Strings>
    <Section>s2-0</Section>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>5287</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>&lt;speed:0&gt;&lt;scale:140&gt;休憩しますか？
　はい　
　いいえ　</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>&lt;speed:0&gt;&lt;scale:140&gt;Quer descansar?
Sim
Não</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>4</SpeakerId>
      <Id>23</Id>
      <Status>Done</Status>
    </Entry>
  </Strings>
  <Strings>
    <Section>s2-1</Section>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>555</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>……前に来た時には、
こんなものはなかった……</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Não havia nada aqui da última
vez que viemos...</EnglishText>
      <Notes>This set of text boxes needs a mass duplication regarding linebreak work</Notes>
      <SpeakerId>5</SpeakerId>
      <Id>24</Id>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>584</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>ラッキー!!　前に来た時には
何もなかったのに！</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Que sorte! Da última vez
não havia nada aqui!</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>5</SpeakerId>
      <Id>25</Id>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>613</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>うむ……以前、ここには
何もなかったと思うが……</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Hmm... Não me lembro de haver
nada aqui da última vez...</EnglishText>
      <Notes>This one's Eugene I think</Notes>
      <SpeakerId>5</SpeakerId>
      <Id>26</Id>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>643</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>まさか、こんなところに……
とても意外な感じね。</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Nunca imaginei encontrar algo
aqui, logo neste lugar...</EnglishText>
      <Notes>This one's Annie I think</Notes>
      <SpeakerId>5</SpeakerId>
      <Id>27</Id>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>673</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>おう、こんなとこに発見が！
おどろき桃の木だぜ！</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Olha só que coisa! Quem diria
que eu acharia algo aqui!</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>5</SpeakerId>
      <Id>28</Id>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>703</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>こんなところに……
そう、こんな事もあるのね。</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Como isso veio parar aqui...?
Bom, acho que essas coisas
acontecem.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>5</SpeakerId>
      <Id>29</Id>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>722</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>初めてのアイテム会話</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>First Time Item Conversation</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>5</SpeakerId>
      <Id>30</Id>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>563</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>一度行った場所でも、
何か見つかる場合が
あるという事か……</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Então dá pra achar coisas mesmo
em lugares onde já estivemos...</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>5</SpeakerId>
      <Id>31</Id>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>592</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>一度行ったところでも、
調べに行ったら、
新しい発見があるかもネ！</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>A gente pode descobrir coisas
em outros lugares que já
visitamos!</EnglishText>
      <Notes>don't feel I nailed Mao's tone completely</Notes>
      <SpeakerId>5</SpeakerId>
      <Id>32</Id>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>621</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>一度行った場所でも、
新しい発見があるかもしれんな。</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Suponho que possamos encontrar
coisas em lugares que já
visitamos.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>5</SpeakerId>
      <Id>33</Id>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>651</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>一度行った場所でも、こうやって
調べたら何かみつかるかも……？</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Talvez possamos encontrar coisas
novas se explorarmos lugares
onde já estivemos...?</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>5</SpeakerId>
      <Id>34</Id>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>681</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>前に行った場所でも、
もういっぺん行ってみたら、
何か見つかるかもしれないな！</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Talvez a gente ache coisas novas
em outros lugares onde já
estivemos também!</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>5</SpeakerId>
      <Id>35</Id>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>711</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>行った事がある場所でも、
もう一度調べたら、何か見つかる
かもしれないって事ね……
</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Talvez possamos encontrar coisas
em outros lugares se voltarmos
a eles de novo...</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>5</SpeakerId>
      <Id>36</Id>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>730</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>初めてのアイテム会話</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>First Time Item Conversation</EnglishText>
